---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Gosub // System Override</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style lang="scss">
      :root {
        --bg: #050510;
        --cyan: #00f3ff;
        --pink: #ff00ff;
        --yellow: #fcee0a;
        --text: #e0e0e0;
        --font-display: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        --font-body: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      
      body {
        background-color: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        line-height: 1.5;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .scanlines {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2));
        background-size: 100% 4px;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 100;
        opacity: 0.6;
      }

      .vignette {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 50%, #000 150%);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 99;
      }

      .cyber-grid {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 50vh;
        background-image: 
          linear-gradient(transparent 65%, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4) 66%, transparent 68%),
          linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 65%, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3) 66%, transparent 68%);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        transform: perspective(500px) rotateX(60deg) translateY(100px) translateZ(-200px);
        animation: gridMove 2s linear infinite;
        z-index: -1;
      }

      @keyframes gridMove {
        from { background-position: 0 0; }
        to { background-position: 0 40px; }
      }

      header {
        padding: 2rem 4rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cyan);
        box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);
        background: rgba(5, 5, 16, 0.8);
        backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;

        .logo {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          font-size: 2rem;
          font-weight: 900;
          color: var(--cyan);
          text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--cyan);
          letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        nav a {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          color: var(--pink);
          text-decoration: none;
          margin-left: 2rem;
          font-size: 1rem;
          letter-spacing: 2px;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          transition: 0.3s;
          text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.5);

          &:hover {
            color: var(--yellow);
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--yellow);
          }
        }
      }

      main {
        padding: 4rem;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .hero {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 10vh;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;

        h1 {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
          font-weight: 900;
          line-height: 1;
          color: transparent;
          -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--cyan);
          text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.5);
          text-transform: uppercase;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
          position: relative;

          &::before {
            content: "GOSUB ENGINE";
            position: absolute;
            left: -2px; text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--pink);
            top: 0; color: var(--text); background: var(--bg);
            overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 900px, 0, 0);
            animation: glitch-anim 3s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
          }
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
          color: var(--text);
          max-width: 800px;
          margin: 2rem auto;
          background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
          padding: 1rem;
          border: 1px solid var(--pink);
          box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);
          border-left: 10px solid var(--yellow);
        }
      }

      @keyframes glitch-anim {
        0% { clip: rect(10px, 9999px, 86px, 0); }
        5% { clip: rect(65px, 9999px, 14px, 0); }
        10% { clip: rect(93px, 9999px, 8px, 0); }
        15% { clip: rect(12px, 9999px, 55px, 0); }
        20% { clip: rect(31px, 9999px, 42px, 0); }
        100% { clip: rect(31px, 9999px, 42px, 0); }
      }

      .panels {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 5rem;

        .panel {
          flex: 1;
          background: rgba(20, 20, 30, 0.8);
          border: 1px solid var(--cyan);
          padding: 2rem;
          position: relative;
          transition: 0.3s;
          overflow: hidden;

          &::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%; width: 100%; height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--yellow));
            transition: 0.5s;
          }

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-5px);

            &::before { left: 100%; }
            h3 { color: var(--yellow); text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--yellow); }
          }

          h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            color: var(--pink);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
          }

          p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #aaa;
          }
        }
      }

      .status-terminal {
        margin-top: 5rem;
        background: #000;
        border: 2px solid var(--text);
        padding: 2rem;
        font-family: monospace;
        color: var(--cyan);
        position: relative;

        &::after {
          content: 'TERMINAL_READY';
          position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 20px;
          background: var(--bg); padding: 0 10px;
          color: var(--yellow); font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .line {
          margin: 0.5rem 0;
          &::before { content: '>'; color: var(--pink); margin-right: 10px; }
        }
      }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="scanlines"></div>
    <div class="vignette"></div>
    <div class="cyber-grid"></div>

    <header>
      <div class="logo">GOSUB</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#spec">Specs</a>
        <a href="#repo">Repo</a>
        <a href="#init">Init_Seq</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>GOSUB ENGINE</h1>
        <p>A modular browser engine compiled in Rust. Bypass the corporate mainframe. Swap the renderer, inject your layout system, control the runtime.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="panels">
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>MODULAR CORE</h3>
          <p>Trait-based architecture. Disconnect the layout engine and plug in your own logic. Full override capability.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>GPU ACCELERATION</h3>
          <p>Rendering powered by Vello. Harness extreme parallel compute for high-framerate graphical output.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>ZERO MONOCULTURE</h3>
          <p>The web is trapped in a trinary system. We are the rogue process breaking the constraints.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="status-terminal">
        <div class="line">INITIALIZING GOSUB_KERNEL... [OK]</div>
        <div class="line">LOADING HTML5_PARSER... [ACTIVE - VALID DOM]</div>
        <div class="line">LOADING CSS3_ENGINE... [ACTIVE - FULL AST]</div>
        <div class="line">MOUNTING GPU_RENDERER (VELLO)... [ONLINE]</div>
        <div class="line">AWAITING CONTRIBUTOR_INPUT... _</div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
